# skills.c's gain and spells, with only area_update running, in the temple (3001), where Smokegod (60) puts a
# guildmaster (9500, a trainer). Decimus (10) trains; Pupil (10) looks for a trainer.
# - gain with no trainer here (Pupil, before the guildmaster comes); gain with nothing, list, convert and points
#   (not ready, then ready), a group, a skill, a spell (the whole group is needed), something already known,
#   something beyond the class, something too dear, and nothing it knows
# - spells: Decimus's and Pupil's (warriors: none), the refusals, then Smokegod's with every skill set: his,
#   up to level 10, and all; then Decimus as a mage with every skill, whose low level shows each spell's mana
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect pupil
Pupil
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer pupil 3001
@as pupil
gain list
@as god
@mob 9500 3001
@as dec
gain
gain convert
gain points
@as god
set char decimus practice 30
set char decimus train 40
@as dec
gain list
gain convert
gain points
gain weaponsmaster
gain weaponsmaster
gain sneak
gain armor
gain parry
gain 'fast healing'
gain hand to hand
gain nonsense
@as god
set char decimus train 1
@as dec
gain dagger
spells
spells all
@as pupil
spells
spells all
spells 5
spells 1 20
spells 20 1
spells x
spells 1 x
spells 99
spells 1 99
@as god
set skill smokegod all 100
spells
spells 1 10
spells all
set char decimus class mage
set skill decimus all 100
@as dec
spells
spells all
@state
